        <mxCell id="cell_177" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#37474F;" value="&lt;b&gt;Participation &amp;amp; Structural Constraints Rules:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;color: #0F4761;&quot;&gt;Thick / Double Line (═══)&lt;/b&gt;: Total Participation (Mandatory / Existence Dependency)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;color: #455A64;&quot;&gt;Thin Line (───)&lt;/b&gt;: Partial Participation (Optional Existence)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cardinality Ratios&lt;/b&gt;: 1:1 (One-to-One), 1:N (One-to-Many), M:N (Many-to-Many)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;color: #D32F2F;&quot;&gt;ISA [t, d]&lt;/b&gt;: Total Specialization (Covering) &amp;amp; Disjoint Constraint (No Overlap)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;color: #0288D1;&quot;&gt;Aggregation Container [Dashed Box]&lt;/b&gt;: High-level encapsulation of clinical encounter" vertex="1">
